            <title>[LU-21121] TCU: trash stub/uid dirs created before permission and ENOTEMPTY checks (leak, DoS)</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21121</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Problem"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;mdd_unlink()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;mdd_dir.c:2163-2179&lt;/tt&gt;) and &lt;tt&gt;mdd_rename()&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;tt&gt;:3713-3727&lt;/tt&gt;) call &lt;tt&gt;mdd_trash_param_prep()&lt;/tt&gt; &lt;b&gt;before&lt;/b&gt; &lt;tt&gt;mdd_unlink_sanity_check()&lt;/tt&gt; and before the not-empty check.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;prep&lt;/tt&gt; runs &lt;tt&gt;mdd_trash_create()&lt;/tt&gt; in its own &lt;b&gt;committed&lt;/b&gt; transactions to create:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the per-uid dir&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the pFID stub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;for striped dirs, a full striped stub via &lt;tt&gt;mdd_trash_striped_create()&lt;/tt&gt; (a cross-MDT DTX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Consequences:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;An &lt;tt&gt;rm&lt;/tt&gt; the user has no permission for, or an &lt;tt&gt;rmdir&lt;/tt&gt; of a non-empty dir, still leaves persistent trash directories behind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Nothing garbage-collects them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;An unprivileged user can drive repeated distributed transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Reproducer"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Reproducer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Count the objects under &lt;tt&gt;.lustre/.ltrash&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Attempt a denied &lt;tt&gt;rm&lt;/tt&gt;, then &lt;tt&gt;rmdir&lt;/tt&gt; of a non-empty plain dir and of a non-empty striped dir.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Count the objects again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expected:&lt;/b&gt; the count is unchanged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Suggestedfix"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Suggested fix&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run prep after the sanity checks, ideally creating the stubs inside the unlink transaction. Otherwise, GC empty stubs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
